中系统损失的机械能 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\Delta E ;"},{"type":"text","value":"\n(3)结合体第一次滑上长方形板至返回H点所通过的路程 "},{"type":"math","value":"s ;"},{"type":"text","value":"\n(4)此后，不断平行AB平移弹簧a到适当位置且保持与AB边夹角不变，以保证结合体能返回H点。每当结合体通过H点压缩弹簧b时，对其补充机械能 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\Delta E' = 1 J"},{"type":"text","value":"求最终两弹簧处于原长时自由端的距离 "},{"type":"math","value":"L"},{"type":"text","value":" 8\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/78456db5afce2fd07168349cf4c43f17abdd291b6eab85a177382ca6224bb015.png","width":662,"height":459,"width_mm":77.664,"row_group":"jiaxing-moni-2604-q17-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n第17题图\n\n原卷公共参数：可能用到的相关公式或参数:重力加速度g均取 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\mathbf{10m/s^{2}}"},{"type":"text","value":"。\n"}],"choices":[],"answer":{"status":"source","key":null,"body":[{"type":"text","value":"（1）根据能量守恒定律："},{"type":"math","value":"E_P=\\frac12mv_1^2"},{"type":"text","value":"，可得"},{"type":"math","value":"v_1=4\\,\\mathrm{m/s}"},{"type":"score","value":"（1分）"},{"type":"text","value":"。"},{"type":"text","value":"\n由圆周运动最低点受力："},{"type":"math","value":"F_N-mg=m\\frac{(v_1\\sin\\theta)^2}{R}"},{"type":"text","value":"，可得"},{"type":"math","value":"F_N=10.08\\,\\mathrm N"},{"type":"score","value":"（1分）"},{"type":"text","value":"。"},{"type":"text","value":"\n（2）根据动量守恒定律："},{"type":"math","value":"mv_1=2mv_{\\text{共}}"},{"type":"text","value":"，可得"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{\\text{共}}=2\\,\\mathrm{m/s}"},{"type":"score","value":"（1分）"},{"type":"text","value":"。"},{"type":"text","value":"\n损失的机械能："},{"type":"math","value":"\\Delta E=E_{k1}-E_{k{\\text{共}}}=\\frac12mv_1^2-\\frac12\\times2mv_{\\text{共}}^2=4\\,\\mathrm J"},{"type":"score","value":"（1分）"},{"type":"text","value":"。"},{"type":"text","value":"\n（3）结合体首次进入长方形板 ABCD 至压缩到弹簧 b 最短，"},{"type":"text","value":"\n根据受力分析："},{"type":"math","value":"f_{\\text{滑}}=2\\alpha mgx=4x"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"type":"math","value":"F_{\\text{弹}}=kx=12x"},{"type":"text","value":"。"},{"type":"text","value":"\n根据动能定理："},{"type":"math","value":"-\\frac12[k+2\\alpha mg]x^2=0-E_{k{\\text{共}}}"},{"type":"score","value":"（1分）"},{"type":"text","value":"，可得"},{"type":"math","value":"E_{k{\\text{共}}}=8x^2"},{"type":"score","value":"（1分）"},{"type":"text","value":"。"},{"type":"text","value":"\n由此可得"},{"type":"math","value":"x=\\frac{\\sqrt2}2\\,\\mathrm m"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"type":"math","value":"s=2x=\\sqrt2\\,\\mathrm m"},{"type":"score","value":"（1分）"},{"type":"text","value":"。"},{"type":"text","value":"\n（4）结合体首次进入长方形板 ABCD 至返回 H 点处所，"},{"type":"text","value":"\n根据动能定理："},{"type":"math","value":"-\\frac12[2\\alpha mg]x^2\\times2=E'_{k{\\text{共}}}-E_{k{\\text{共}}}"},{"type":"text","value":"，可得"},{"type":"math","value":"E'_{k{\\text{共}}}=4x^2"},{"type":"text","value":"。"},{"type":"text","value":"\n综合（3）中的结论推理可知，结合体从进入长方形板 ABCD 压缩弹簧 b 至返回 H 点，即在特殊材料上往返一次后："},{"type":"math","value":"E_{k{\\text{共进H}}}=2E_{k{\\text{共出H}}}"},{"type":"score","value":"（1分）"},{"type":"text","value":"。"},{"type":"text","value":"\n由于补偿能量后最终达到动态平衡："},{"type":"math","value":"E_{k{\\text{共进H}}}=E_{k{\\text{共出H}}}+\\Delta E'"},{"type":"score","value":"（1分）"},{"type":"text","value":"，可得"},{"type":"math","value":"E_{k{\\text{共出H}}}=1\\,\\mathrm J"},{"type":"score","value":"（1分）"},{"type":"text","value":"。"},{"type":"text","value":"\n勘误：圆弧段最大偏角很小，结合体在圆弧面上的运动可近似视为简谐运动，"},{"type":"text","value":"\n故运动时间"},{"type":"math","value":"t\\approx\\frac12T_3=\\pi\\sqrt{\\frac Rg}=\\sqrt5\\pi\\,\\mathrm s"},{"type":"score","value":"（1分）"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"type":"math","value":"L=\\sqrt{\\frac{E_{k{\\text{共出H}}}}{m}}\\cdot t\\cos\\theta\\approx\\frac{\\sqrt{15}}2\\pi\\,\\mathrm m"},{"type":"score","value":"（1分）"},{"type":"text","value":"。"}]}},{"id":"zj-26-erkao--jiaxing-moni-2604-q18","paper_id":"zj-26-erkao--jiaxing-moni-2604","source_question_id":"jiaxing-moni-2604-q18","number":"18","order":18,"type":"计算题","topics":["力学","电学","光学","近代物理"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"443f62fb11beb3d4c8be7c6e07d2bf373c5ab5075fa16cd992078f2ca22e2e0b","body":[{"type":"text","value":"18.（13分）如图所示，粒子源能释放初速可视为0的带电粒子，并从 "},{"type":"math","value":"O_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":" 进入加速区，沿 "},{"type":"math","value":"O_{1}O_{2}"},{"type":"text","value":" 连线加速后垂直进入偏转区（长"},{"type":"math","value":"\\times"},{"type":"text","value":"宽"},{"type":"math","value":"\\times"},{"type":"text","value":"高 "},{"type":"math","value":"=4d \\times 4d \\times 7d"},{"type":"text","value":"）底部中心 "},{"type":"math","value":"O_{2}"},{"type":"text","value":" ，随后从狭缝进入接收区，最终被可水平移动的收集板接收。收集板与偏转区右侧面形状相同并对齐，狭缝上 "},{"type":"math","value":"O_{3}"},{"type":"text","value":" 点与收集板上 "},{"type":"math","value":"O_{4}"},{"type":"text","value":" 点等高；加速区竖直方向存在电压可调的匀强电场；偏转区存在匀强磁场Ⅰ，方向可调且垂直于 "},{"type":"math","value":"O_{1},O_{2},O_{3},O_{4}"},{"type":"text","value":" 所构成的竖直平面。\n(1)若粒子源产生比荷分别为25k和4k的正离子a和 b，当加速电压为 U时，正离子a恰能垂直击中 "},{"type":"math","value":"O_{4}"},{"type":"text","value":" 求\n①匀强磁场Ⅰ的磁感应强度B大小；\n②收集板能收集到两种正离子时，离狭缝的最大水平距离 "},{"type":"math","value":"x ;"},{"type":"text","value":"\n③若在接收区加上磁感应强度大小为磁场Ⅰ的3倍且水平向右的匀强磁场Ⅱ则收集板向右移动时，a和b落点的连线在收集板上扫过的区域面积S。\n(2)若粒子源产生大量电子且收集板用金属钨制成，当高速电子轰击钨核时，动能以一定的比例转化为辐射能并释放X射线。若动能转化比例为100%，就可辐射出能量最大的X射线，但此类X射线辐射强度几乎为0。X射线辐射强度随波长的具体分布如图乙所示（所有被加速的电子都能全部击中收集板），请利用图中数据计算普朗克常量h。\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/074fe2bd94817e2f3175addf9431c2ef426cbcd5409f168b02e4798ca30362c6.png","width":383,"height":566,"width_mm":44.919,"row_group":"jiaxing-moni-2604-q18-row1"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/33a59bb7cd1d2b6346f4f4dca3e9f08fa4bfbd51137de62c6abcf2fc7beada12.png","width":283,"height":395,"width_mm":33.165,"row_group":"jiaxing-moni-2604-q18-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n图甲 装置结构图\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/da4b918ba6ebb45a8e68d5285fcf8a5a3f56038ed8e7eb77c0ee1b4c1b965528.png","width":504,"height":479,"width_mm":65.112,"row_group":"jiaxing-moni-2604-q18-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n图乙 电子轰击钨靶的能谱图\n\n原卷公共参数：可能用到的相关公式或参数:重力加速度g均取 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\mathbf{10m/s^{2}}"},{"type":"text","value":"。